  "described": {
    "alt_text": "Black line drawing on white of a valley with rocky slopes, rounded shrubs, trees, a stream and a few small houses, about half complete with an empty band at top and centre.",
    "description": "A square image of black line work only, with the reference layers hidden. The lower two thirds are densely drawn: rocky slopes, clumps of rounded shrubs, a waterfall falling into a pool at bottom right, a stream winding down from the left, a tall pine at the left edge, two small houses on a ledge at left, flat topped trees on the horizon line at left, and a bushy tree at the right. The top quarter and a gap in the upper middle are blank white where the lake, mountains and house are still to come.",
    "impression": "Halfway, and already unmistakably a drawing rather than a generated picture: the rocks have become cartoon lumps and the shrubs are scalloped clouds of line. The empty white band at the top is like a held breath before the lake and the house go in.",
